 "notes": [
  "Format Premiere - Tatooine: posted 13 June 2001, before Coruscant, and the list has no Coruscant-set card.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': Quiet Mining Colony / Independent Operation, Bespin, Cloud City: Guest Quarters, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Keeping The Empire Out Forever, Squadron Assignments, Battle Plan; they count toward the 60. Several Effects start and the objective names none, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "The strategy opens with an edit: 'Start Menace fades not battle plan + there are 4 effects not 5'. The list is kept as published (Battle Plan under Starting, Menace Fades under Effects; the Effects section holds 4 cards though headed 'Effects(5)'). Total 60 as published.",
  "Posted 'Qui-Gon's Lightsaber' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber: Qui-Gon's Lightsaber is a Reflections III card (October 2001), after this post.",
  "Posted 'Stay Sharp (Tech)' dested Stay Sharp! (the post calls it a tech used interrupt); 'Wedge Antillies, RSL' dested Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Red 7' is the Special Edition starship Red 7 (Elyhek Rue's X-wing).",
  "Posted 'EPP Luke/Obi/Han/Leia' dested Luke With Lightsaber, Obi-Wan With Lightsaber, Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol, Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'ECC Chewie/Lando' dested Chewie With Blaster Rifle, Lando With Blaster Pistol; 'Houijix & Out of Nowhere' dested Houjix & Out Of Nowhere; 'SATM & Blaster Proficiency' dested Sorry About The Mess & •Blaster Proficiency; 'Intruder Missle' dested Intruder Missile; 'Millenium Falcon' dested Millennium Falcon."
